.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Select the <strong><u>Preincts In</u></strong> tab to find details on precinct that have reported results.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Select the <strong><u>Turnout Details</u></strong> tab to find statistics on election day voter turnout</p>","dismissButtonLabel":"ok","headerLayout":"vertical","logoImageURL":"https://berks.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/70ab03c8aae5497ca50e6c1e02fc6118/data","logoSize":"small","dontShowAgainOption":false}},"elementMappings":{}}